  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> denotes the sum of all the coefficients in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> denotes the sum of all the coefficients in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>, then :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Sum of the coefficients in the expansion of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(putting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)</p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Sum of the coefficients in the expansion of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>Clearly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>.</p>"
  }
